{
  "name": "VMRay1: Report on demand (Hash + URL)",
  "uuid": "9f3bd5d5-e0b9-4dd5-a431-2937c5f98237",
  "tags": [
    "Alerts",
    "Enrichment",
    "VMRay1"
  ],
  "workspace": "Operation Center",
  "description": "Run by an analyst on an alert. Extracts the file hashes (file.hash.* / process.hash.*) and the http(s) url.original of the alert's first event. Hashes are looked up in VMRay's existing analyses (no quota); a URL is submitted to VMRay (consumes quota) and Get Submission Result waits for the analysis (up to 60 minutes). For each, the full VMRay report is posted as an alert comment with its screenshots, and the IOCs are pushed to an IOC collection. Before use: select your VMRay1 account on the VMRay1 nodes, and set ioc_collection_id on both 'Add IOCs to IOC Collection' nodes.",
